  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water.\n• Cook potato in boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add milk, butter and a generous pinch of salt and mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f7bb005b8327b10d6817/step-f71d2a36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Dip the haloumi slices into the flour mixture, followed by egg, and finally in the panko breadcrumbs. Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f7bb005b8327b10d6817/step-9dfdeb7f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 minutes each side. Set aside on a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f7bb005b8327b10d6817/step-ab71eee9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, grate carrot. Transfer to medium bowl and add slaw mix.\n• Add 1/2 the mayo and a drizzle of vinegar. Toss to coat and season.\n• Slice chicken. Divide chicken schnitzel, mash and slaw between plates.\n• Serve with remaining mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f7bb005b8327b10d6817/step-ccfbd9f8.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
